{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a strange room. A large mirror stands before you, reflecting you and everything around\u2014but something is off: details don't match, objects are misplaced, and lighting behaves oddly. To escape, you'll need to restore perfect symmetry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you open the door, you find yourself in an identical room. The only difference is the number on the door, which increases by one if you've correctly reproduced the symmetry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you reach the final room and break the cycle of endless reflection?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique symmetry-restoring puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric horror with psychological tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive environmental interactions: move objects, adjust lighting, discover hidden details.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way out.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2527330?t=1762822321","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2527330?t=1762822321","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527330/7c89e6ca94853bf486a206005e746f8ca07378cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762822321","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527330/7c89e6ca94853bf486a206005e746f8ca07378cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762822321","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3973200,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a strange room. A large mirror stands before you, reflecting you and everything around\u2014but something is off: details don't match, objects are misplaced, and lighting behaves oddly. To escape, you'll need to restore perfect symmetry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you open the door, you find yourself in an identical room. The only difference is the number on the door, which increases by one if you've correctly reproduced the symmetry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you reach the final room and break the cycle of endless reflection?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique symmetry-restoring puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric horror with psychological tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive environmental interactions: move objects, adjust lighting, discover hidden details.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way out.</p>","developers":["TAMAGOSHA"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2527330/e4ffb7fcfc729f19db1a801355f4a49ae4e53c5f/header.jpg?t=1762822321","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2527330/981117550/15994dfe64e0a3e3faa8e56b26db071df51e12c1/1755696024/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755826635","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2527330/981117550/15994dfe64e0a3e3faa8e56b26db071df51e12c1/1755696024/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755826635","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2527330/981117550/15994dfe64e0a3e3faa8e56b26db071df51e12c1/1755696024/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755826635","id":257186043,"name":"MERROR Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257186043/0b583f3af52cf9d70b068a2d45e431233f71589a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755826635"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.a